1.9 Justification of the Project
The indigenous chicken broiler enterprise was selected because:
1.	There is high demand for kienyeji chicken meat.
2.	Indigenous birds are adaptable to local conditions.
3.	The enterprise requires relatively small space.
4.	Poultry has a short production cycle.
5.	Manure can be sold to crop farmers.
6.	The enterprise provides practical learning opportunities.
7.	Climate-smart practices can easily be adopted.
8.	The project promotes entrepreneurship skills.
